# ariella.website agent protocol

Read `AGENTS.md` first. It lists the three docs that matter: `STATUS.md`, `docs/DESIGN-RESET.md`, and `docs/DECISION_LOG.md`.

- `docs/archive/` is history. Do not execute it.
- One step at a time, only when Ari asks.
- Mockups before any design change in the repo.
- Ari merges PRs. Merging to `main` deploys to the live domain.
- Append answered questions to `docs/DECISION_LOG.md`.
